.DS_Store

# Android/Gradle generated state
**/.gradle/
**/.kotlin/
**/.idea/
**/build/
**/.cxx/
**/outputs/
**/intermediates/
**/artifacts/
**/local.properties
**/keystore.properties
**/.pnpm-store/

# Credentials, private keys and deployment state
**/.dev.vars*
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx

# Generated DEX, mappings and local logs
**/classes.dex
**/*.apk
**/*.aab
**/*.apks
**/*.dex
**/mappings/
**/skidfuscator*.log
**/skidfuscator-error-*.txt
**/*.bak

# Workspace-only leftovers
/_ksu_src_*/
/.codex-*/
/.adb/
/.android/
/.android-local/
/.gradle-local/
/analytics.settings
/skidfuscator.log
